  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Setting up a Clean Cooking Unit in the Ministry of Energy and Mineral Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects aims to transition to clean cooking technologies, such as improved biomass cookstoves and electric stoves, as this will significantly improve health issues. For example, around 50 000 premature deaths from indoor air pollution per year by 2030 will be avoided while households will be saved of two hours per day in collecting firewood &#x2013; with the greatest benefits accruing to women and children</narrative>
  </description>
